Z||000000||Mach10||08-11-2001||02:45 PM||||Anyone remember a while back that I was bitchin' about my decklid that would catapult slurpees over my front bumper? Well I was giving the car a wash, and hosed off my engine compartment (with it running. No way in hell would I do it with the engine off  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) and decided to blast the underside of my filthy decklid (@#$@%ing dirt roads  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ). After stripping off the thick layer of crud, I noticed something peeling up. Black duct tape. What the hell?!? After some further cleaning, I found 4 more strips, two per side of the decklid. It appears to me that at one point, my decklid DID have a spoiler on it, but the holes were filled. Sum'***** .||||reg||10
